  },
  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Gavony is described as a region where Macher's church and Liont's smithy stand, and where Avacyn finds the lost boy Maeli and returns him to his mother Kelse.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09",
     "gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e1",
     "gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=Avacyn%20fixed%20the%20location,a%20few%20minutes%20away.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=It%20took%20only%20moments,give%20her%20the%20child."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Afterward a violent shimmer racks Avacyn and she sees the child with disgust, then flees the scene.",
    "cites": [
     "gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e3",
     "gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e4",
     "gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e5"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=A%20violent%20shimmer%20wracked,body%2C%20shaking%20her%20vision.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=The%20seeds%20of%20men%20are%20rotten.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=Avacyn%20fled%2C%20seeking%20refuge%20from%20her%20own%20mind."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Jace reaches the Gavony moors and finds a twisted cryptolith, and a journal entry notes that the cryptoliths warp mana flow with potentially severe effects on angels.",
    "cites": [
     "drownyard-temple-2016-04-06-e0",
     "drownyard-temple-2016-04-06-e3",
     "drownyard-temple-2016-04-06-e5"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=It%20was%20still%20evening%20when%20he%20reached%20Gavony.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=The%20monolith%20was%20unmistakably,seen%20in%20the%20journal.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/drownyard-temple-2016-04-06#:~:text=The%20disruptive%20properties%20of,mana%20through%20the%20region"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It is also the region where Grete's caravan was ambushed, and Gisa escapes in the chaos when skaabs attack.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/games-2016-04-27",
     "games-2016-04-27-e1"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/games-2016-04-27",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/games-2016-04-27#:~:text=we%20were%20overcome%20by,ghastly%2C%20violent%2C%20misshapen%20skaabs."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Thalia's party in Gavony meets Rem Karolus, who carries Avacyn's broken spear and confirms she is dead, and Thalia mounts the spear as the order's banner and tells her army Avacyn is gone.",
    "cites": [
     "saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e1",
     "saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e3",
     "saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e4"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=Even%20with%20its%20tip,Avacyn%27s%20spear%20was%20unmistakable.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=We%20ride%20under%20this%20banner%20now%2C",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=For%20the%20memory%20of,the%20world%2C%20we%20fight%21"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Olivia Voldaren parleys with Thalia in midair, and they agree that vampires and humans will not harm each other until the fight is over.",
    "cites": [
     "saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e7",
     "saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13-e8"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=I%27m%20Olivia%20Voldaren%2C%20lady,of%20the%20Voldaren%20line.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/saint-traft-and-flight-nightmares-2016-07-13#:~:text=No%20vampire%20bite%20or,Heir%20of%20Saint%20Traft."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In Crimson Vow, Gavony is where the Betzold family lived, where an old woman says Dennick holed up in the old family mansion, and where Feuer saw vampire effigies being prepared for Harvesttide.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15",
     "episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15-e5",
     "p:stories/episode-4-harvesttide-2021-09-22"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-fall-house-betzold-2021-09-15#:~:text=%22He%20holed%20up%20in%20the%20old%20family%20mansion.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-4-harvesttide-2021-09-22"
    ]
   }
